# Cloudflare Pages redirects. This file is passthrough-copied to the build
# output as `_redirects`, which is where Pages reads it from.
#
# 302 and not 301: this is a stand-in for a page that is coming, and a permanent
# redirect is cached by browsers long after the destination stops being the right
# one. Both spellings, because the app links without the trailing slash and a
# reader who types it will add one.
/muretto /products/guido/#muretto 302
/muretto/ /products/guido/#muretto 302
